WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:05.500
One of the things I want to talk about with
you a little bit later today is that Corona

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:13.810
virus is creating a perfect screen or veil
for pushing hyper nationalist policy in the

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:19.970
United States, something that we've seen Donald
Trump and the people around him clearly desire

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.740
to do since day one.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:27.679
Even before day one of the administration,
we knew that bamboozling people with hyper

00:00:27.679 --> 00:00:29.489
nationalist rhetoric worked really well.

00:00:29.489 --> 00:00:34.310
But before I tell you all of the ways in which
hyper nationalism is sort of rearing its head

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:38.530
during Corona virus, I have to tell you about
the acute latest way in which this is happening,

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:44.050
which is that Donald Trump announced yesterday
on Twitter that he's suspending all immigration

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:51.190
to the United States under the pretense of
mitigation and public health and corona virus

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:52.190
safety.

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:57.200
Now, this might be believable if Donald Trump
had been on the side of public health all

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.200
along.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.200
In other cases.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.580
But he's not been he's been tweeting about
we've got to liberate states.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:02.580
States should open.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.890
The country's ready to open.

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:09.899
Trump is at the same time understand saying
things are going so well that we can reopen,

00:01:09.899 --> 00:01:14.200
but things are going so poorly that we have
to stop all immigration to the United States.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:19.700
So by executive order, Donald Trump claims
he will suspend all immigration.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:24.869
He announced it last night on Twitter saying,
quote, In light of the attack from the invisible

00:01:24.869 --> 00:01:30.539
enemy, as well as the need to protect the
jobs of our great American citizens, I will

00:01:30.539 --> 00:01:35.619
be signing an executive order to temporarily
suspend immigration into the United States.

00:01:35.619 --> 00:01:41.109
Now, the White House was asked how long is
temporarily, what is the legal basis?

00:01:41.109 --> 00:01:42.729
What's the reasoning for this?

00:01:42.729 --> 00:01:45.569
No answers on any of those questions so far.

00:01:45.569 --> 00:01:47.920
And it may indeed actually not be legal.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:54.950
Now, as a practical matter, most immigration
was de facto slowed down or stopped anyway

00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:57.630
because we've got border restrictions and
flight bans.

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:04.549
So understand that this is all nationalist
propaganda and possibly not even legal.

00:02:04.549 --> 00:02:09.759
And what I mean by that is that at the presidential
executive order level, it's not clear a president

00:02:09.759 --> 00:02:15.290
can say immigration is just suspended, but
it's a really great piece of red meat to throw

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:17.350
to his nationalist supporters.

00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:22.520
In practice, if you shut down flights to the
United States from other countries, it's hard

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:24.110
for new immigrants to get here.

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:29.390
If you shut down crossing at the northern
and southern borders of the United States,

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:32.830
it's practically speaking very difficult for
new immigrants to get here.

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:39.200
So realize that the policies themselves that
prevent people from coming here, including

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:45.290
tourists, have been in place for weeks now,
which effectively has actually stopped immigration.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:49.610
That's not really what's at issue with that
issue, is that the announcement that by executive

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:56.070
order Trump is suspending immigration may
not be a legal thing and it may actually change

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:57.400
very little in practice.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.370
So why is Trump doing this?

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:04.690
It's because he wants to placate his base
with hyper nationalist red meat.

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:06.840
The hypocrisy is stunning.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:12.310
And you only need to look as far again as
Donald Trump saying we're ready to open in

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:14.100
a whole bunch of different states.

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:16.550
We've almost won against the invisible enemy.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:20.620
Trump is fomenting protests that are demanding
that we reopen.

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:25.430
And yet, he says things are so uniquely bad
that I'm going to do something that has not

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:30.420
been done before, which is I'm going to suspend
all immigration for public health reasons

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:33.380
because we are fighting the so-called invisible
enemy.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:42.240
It's completely incoherent unless you understand
that Corona virus is merely a filter through

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:48.820
which Donald Trump can push his preexisting
nationalist ideas to fire up his base.

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:51.720
We know that this has Stephen Miller's fingerprints
all over it.

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:56.220
Much like America first and a whole bunch
of the other nationalist nonsense that Donald

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:57.720
Trump has been spouting.

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:01.410
And then last thing here, and then I want
to move on to the bigger hyper nationalist

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:08.670
picture, as always, with the things that Donald
Trump tweets that he will be doing.

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:10.390
Sometimes he never actually does it.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:16.209
So we do have to keep an eye on whether Trump
actually does sign this executive order.

00:04:16.209 --> 00:04:18.040
As of now, he hasn't hasn't done it.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:25.510
Let's now move on to the conversation of the
ultra nationalism that is being promulgated

00:04:25.510 --> 00:05:49.610
under the guise of Corona virus.

